### ========================================
### MULTIPLAYER GAME SYSTEM - API REQUESTS
### ========================================

### IMPORTANT: Replace these placeholders:
# YOUR_GM_TOKEN - Token from GM login
# YOUR_PLAYER_TOKEN - Token from player login
# YOUR_GAME_ID - Game ID from create game response
# YOUR_CHARACTER_ID - Character ID from character creation

### ========================================
### 1. GAME MANAGEMENT
### ========================================

### Lista wszystkich aktywnych gier (PUBLIC)
GET http://localhost:8080/games

###

### Szczegóły konkretnej gry (PUBLIC)
# Replace YOUR_GAME_ID with actual game ID
GET http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID

###

