### ========================================
### 3. CHARACTER MANAGEMENT ON GRID
### ========================================

### Dodaj postać na pole bitwy
# Replace YOUR_GAME_ID and YOUR_CHARACTER_ID
POST http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/characters
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_GM_TOKEN

{
  "characterId": "YOUR_CHARACTER_ID",
  "positionX": 5,
  "positionY": 5,
  "isEnemy": false
}

###

### Dodaj wroga na pole bitwy
POST http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/characters
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_GM_TOKEN

{
  "characterId": "YOUR_CHARACTER_ID",
  "positionX": 10,
  "positionY": 10,
  "isEnemy": true
}

###

### Przesuń postać na polu bitwy
# Replace YOUR_GAME_ID and YOUR_CHARACTER_ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/characters/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PLAYER_TOKEN

{
  "characterId": "YOUR_CHARACTER_ID",
  "positionX": 7,
  "positionY": 8
}

###

### ========================================
### 4. EXISTING GAME ACTIONS (From old file)
### ========================================

### Walka między postaciami
POST http://localhost:8080/fight
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attacker": {
    "id": "1",
    "modifier": 10
  },
  "defender": {
    "id": "2",
    "modifier": 0
  },
  "zoneId": "battlefield_1"
}

###

### Rzut kością
POST http://localhost:8080/roll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sides": 100
}

###

### Rzut kością d20
POST http://localhost:8080/roll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sides": 20
}

###

### Rzut kością d6
POST http://localhost:8080/roll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sides": 6
}

###

### ========================================
### FULL TESTING WORKFLOW
### ========================================

### STEP 1: Register users (see auth.http)
### STEP 2: Login as GM (see auth.http) - Save token
### STEP 3: Login as Player (see auth.http) - Save token
### STEP 4: Create character (see auth.http) - Save character ID

### STEP 5: Create game as GM
# @name step5CreateGame
POST http://localhost:8080/games
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_GM_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Test Game - Full Workflow"
}

### STEP 6: Get all games to verify creation
GET http://localhost:8080/games

### STEP 7: Join game as Player
# Use game ID from step 5
POST http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/join
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PLAYER_TOKEN

### STEP 8: Add character to grid as GM
POST http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/characters
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_GM_TOKEN

{
  "characterId": "YOUR_CHARACTER_ID",
  "positionX": 3,
  "positionY": 4,
  "isEnemy": false
}

### STEP 9: Move character as Player
PUT http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/characters/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PLAYER_TOKEN

{
  "characterId": "YOUR_CHARACTER_ID",
  "positionX": 5,
  "positionY": 6
}

### STEP 10: Get game details to see all updates
GET http://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID

###

### ========================================
### WEBSOCKET TESTING
### ========================================

### To test WebSocket real-time updates:
###
### 1. Install wscat: npm install -g wscat
###
### 2. Connect to WebSocket (Terminal 1 - GM):
###    wscat -c "ws://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/ws?token=YOUR_GM_TOKEN"
###
### 3. Connect to WebSocket (Terminal 2 - Player):
###    wscat -c "ws://localhost:8080/games/YOUR_GAME_ID/ws?token=YOUR_PLAYER_TOKEN"
###
### 4. Make API calls above and watch real-time events in both terminals!
###
### Expected WebSocket Events:
### - GAME_STATE (on connect)
### - PARTICIPANT_JOINED (when someone joins)
### - PARTICIPANT_LEFT (when someone leaves)
### - CHARACTER_ADDED (when character placed on grid)
### - CHARACTER_MOVED (when character moved)
### - LOG_MESSAGE (game log messages)
### - DICE_ROLLED (dice roll results)

###
